  {
   "id": "b08-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 727,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: S’s own shortest path to Y doesn’t start with S–E",
   "originalText": "The rule: S’s own shortest path to Y doesn’t start with S–E",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b08-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 508,
   "height": 23,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Y ∈ P(S)   ⇔   dist(S,Y)  <  c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)",
   "originalText": "Y ∈ P(S)   ⇔   dist(S,Y)  <  c(S,E) + dist(E,Y)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b08-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 199,
   "width": 962,
   "height": 107,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  The right side is the cheapest path from S to Y that starts with the link S–E.\n•  Strictly cheaper ⇒ no shortest path from S to Y uses S–E. It is B1 with X = S.\n•  A tie means one of S’s shortest paths to Y is the one over S–E: Y is out.\n•  After S–E fails, S can still reach every Y in P(S) on its normal table: no tunnel is needed to get\n   there.",
   "originalText": "•  The right side is the cheapest path from S to Y that starts with the link S–E.\n•  Strictly cheaper ⇒ no shortest path from S to Y uses S–E. It is B1 with X = S.\n•  A tie means one of S’s shortest paths to Y is the one over S–E: Y is out.\n•  After S–E fails, S can still reach every Y in P(S) on its normal table: no tunnel is needed to get\n   there.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b08-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 316,
   "width": 447,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked checks, Example 4 (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Worked checks, Example 4 (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b08-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 350,
   "width": 702,
   "height": 113,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Y     dist(PE1,Y)   c(PE1,P1) + dist(P1,Y)   In P(PE1)?\n----  -----------   ----------------------   ------------------------------\nP2    10            10 + 20 = 30             ✓ 10 < 30\nP3    20            10 + 10 = 20             ✗ tie: PE1 → P1 → P3 is the path\nP4    20            10 + 20 = 30             ✓ 20 < 30   (P1 → P4 is 20)\nPE2   30            10 + 20 = 30             ✗ tie: PE1 → P1 → P3 → PE2 is one",
   "originalText": "Y     dist(PE1,Y)   c(PE1,P1) + dist(P1,Y)   In P(PE1)?\n----  -----------   ----------------------   ------------------------------\nP2    10            10 + 20 = 30             ✓ 10 < 30\nP3    20            10 + 10 = 20             ✗ tie: PE1 → P1 → P3 is the path\nP4    20            10 + 20 = 30             ✓ 20 < 30   (P1 → P4 is 20)\nPE2   30            10 + 20 = 30             ✗ tie: PE1 → P1 → P3 → PE2 is one",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
