   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "b08-text-66",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1051,
   "width": 99,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 522654,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6912114,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Takeaway",
   "originalText": "Takeaway",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b08-text-67",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1089,
   "width": 1590,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 530573,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7016843,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "P-space is every router S already reaches without the failed link: dist(S,Y) < c(S,E) + dist(E,Y). A tie means the link is on a shortest path, so the router is out. It\nis the \"S side\" of Remote LFA; the \"E side\" is Q-space (B10), and a router in both is a PQ node (B11).",
   "originalText": "P-space is every router S already reaches without the failed link: dist(S,Y) < c(S,E) + dist(E,Y). A tie means the link is on a shortest path, so the router is out. It\nis the \"S side\" of Remote LFA; the \"E side\" is Q-space (B10), and a router in both is a PQ node (B11).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b08-text-68",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 1164,
   "width": 1604,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 538492,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7121572,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §3, §6  ·  docs/learn/05-remote-lfa.md (P-space)  ·  examples/04-isp-core.yaml, 02-ring5.yaml, 03-ring5-highmetric.yaml, 08-node-protection.yaml  · \nchecked with computeForSource()",
   "originalText": "Sources: docs/02-algorithms.md §3, §6  ·  docs/learn/05-remote-lfa.md (P-space)  ·  examples/04-isp-core.yaml, 02-ring5.yaml, 03-ring5-highmetric.yaml, 08-node-protection.yaml  · \nchecked with computeForSource()",
